acceptance_criteria: "A proposal that removes the winning duplicate inline definition is judged against the definition that becomes effective, with a spec seeding two definitions for one key; The harness refuses a negated spelling of a declared mutation flag combined with output controls exactly as native dispatch does, with a parity spec"
